{#
  BeMart – Block/category_nav_sp.html.twig
  Mobile-drawer category navigation block (no extends; self-contained include).

  Rendered inside the drawer overlay in base.html.twig on small screens.
  Category set is derived from the Products resource (page://self/products),
  where category_id query parameter filters by the categories declared in
  Products::categoryName().  No Twig variables are injected; the category
  list is static in the resource layer and mirrored here.

  Design language: IdeaStore (idea-* vocabulary).
#}
<nav class="idea-sp-category-nav" aria-label="商品カテゴリ">
  <p class="idea-eyebrow">カテゴリ</p>
  <div class="idea-chip-row">
    <a href="/products?category_id=2">新入荷</a>
    <a href="/products?category_id=1">ジェラート</a>
    <a href="/products?category_id=3">彩のデザート</a>
    <a href="/products?category_id=4">CUBE</a>
    <a href="/products?category_id=5">アイスサンド</a>
    <a href="/products?category_id=6">フルーツ</a>
  </div>
  <a class="idea-view-all" href="/products">すべての商品</a>
</nav>
